To the extent possible under law, the contributors to this repository have waived all
copyright and related or neighbouring rights to the trail data it contains.

Full text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
Summary:   https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

WHY THIS LICENCE

The data here is a list of which public web pages link to which other public web pages. Those
are facts. Nobody should need permission to know that one page links to another, and nobody
should have to credit anyone for finding out.

WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES NOT COVER

Nothing in this repository is anyone else's content, and this dedication is not a claim over
anything beyond the list itself:

  - The PAGES these addresses point to belong to whoever wrote them. This repository contains
    none of their text, and any tool using it fetches those pages from their own servers under
    whatever terms those servers set.

  - Link TEXT is reproduced because it is the only way to know which page is which. A few words
    of navigation label, kept so software can tell "Humid Subtropical" from "Tundra".

  - The documentation files in this repository (README.md, SCHEMA.md, CONTRIBUTING.md) are also
    released under CC0.
